# DN-06 - request mau (IntelliJ HTTP Client hoac VS Code REST Client).
# Chay truoc: Postgres, mock (9000), identity (profile dev), profile-service (profile dev + PROFILE_DEMO_DATA_ENABLED=true),
# recruitment-service, company-service (profile dev), gateway (8080).
# BAT BUOC: INTERNAL_SERVICE_KEY=dev-internal-key cho company, profile VA recruitment (neu khong API tra 503 EXTERNAL_UNAVAILABLE).
# Xem docs/api/DN-06-job-match.md muc "Cach chay" va cong thuc o docs/matching.md.
#
# UUID ung vien KHAC NHAU theo tung database. Lay bang:
#   select id, lms_user_id from public.users where role='CANDIDATE';
# roi dien vao @c1 (lms-sv-001), @c2 (lms-sv-002), @c3 (lms-sv-003) ben duoi.
# Diem mong doi ben duoi tinh tay tu hs01/candidates.json; neu ung vien da mo ho so, NT-05 co the doi diem:
# kiem tra "select * from profile.skill_scores where user_id = ..." roi cap nhat.

@gw = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@c1 = THAY-BANG-UUID-CUA-lms-sv-001
@c2 = THAY-BANG-UUID-CUA-lms-sv-002
@c3 = THAY-BANG-UUID-CUA-lms-sv-003
# Ung vien chua co ky nang nao (bat ky UUID nao khong co diem trong profile-service)
@noSkills = 00000000-0000-0000-0009-000000000009
@jd6 = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000006
@jd7 = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000007
# JD DRAFT cua Cong ty A (DevDataSeeder) - dung de doi min_score. KHONG sua JD6/JD7 bang HR: sua JD APPROVED se dua ve PENDING.
@jdDraft = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000004
# UUID ky nang co dinh cua profile-service (V2__skill_catalog.sql)
@JAVA = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001
@SPRING_BOOT = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000002
@SQL = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000003
@GIT = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000004
@DOCKER = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000011
@ENGLISH = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000017

############################## 1. Token ##############################

### 1a. Xin ve SSO cho staff1 (chi dev) -> 200 {ticket, issuedAt}
# @name staffTicket
POST {{gw}}/auth/dev/sso-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lmsUserId": "lms-st-001" }

### 1b. Doi ve lay token STAFF (trong 60 giay, dung mot lan) -> 200 {accessToken, user}
# @name staffSso
POST {{gw}}/auth/sso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "{{staffTicket.response.body.ticket}}" }

### 1c. Xin ve SSO cho ung vien lms-sv-001 (chi dev) -> 200 {ticket, issuedAt}
# @name c1Ticket
POST {{gw}}/auth/dev/sso-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lmsUserId": "lms-sv-001" }

### 1d. Doi ve lay token ung vien C1 -> 200 {accessToken, user}
# @name c1Sso
POST {{gw}}/auth/sso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "{{c1Ticket.response.body.ticket}}" }

### 1e. hr1 (Cong ty A) -> 200 {accessToken, ...}
# @name hr1Login
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr1@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

############################## 2. Ba vi du tinh tay (STAFF xem moi JD, moi ung vien) ##############################

### 2a. Vi du 1: JD6 x C1 -> 200 score 78, belowMinimum false
# met: Java, Spring Boot, Git. missing: SQL (81.153846/90), Docker (0/50), Tieng Anh (0/60).
# Diem tu khai Tieng Anh 65 KHONG tinh: neu tinh se ra 88.
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/{{c1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2b. Vi du 2: JD7 x C3 -> 200 score 60, belowMinimum true (Git 0 < 30)
# met rong. missing: Git, Java, SQL.
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd7}}/match/{{c3}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2c. Vi du 3: JD6 x ung vien chua co ky nang -> 200 score 0, belowMinimum true
# met rong. missing du 6: Java, Spring Boot, SQL, Docker, Git, Tieng Anh (candidateScore 0 het).
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/{{noSkills}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2d. Them: JD6 x C2 -> 200 (C2: Java 65, SQL 65, Git 80; khong co Spring Boot, Docker, Tieng Anh)
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/{{c2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 3. Ung vien xem diem cua minh ##############################

### 3a. C1 xem JD6 qua /match/me -> 200 score 78 (giong 2a)
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/me
Authorization: Bearer {{c1Sso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3b. C1 xem JD DRAFT -> 404 NOT_FOUND (chi JD APPROVED moi co diem khop cho ung vien)
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}/match/me
Authorization: Bearer {{c1Sso.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 4. Phan quyen ##############################

### 4a. HR xem ung vien CHUA ung tuyen JD6 -> 404 NOT_FOUND "Khong tim thay JD" (HR chi xem ung vien da nop don vao JD cua cong ty minh)
# Neu da co don ung tuyen cua C1 vao JD6 (nop qua UT-01) thi request nay tra 200 score 78.
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/{{c1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4b. Ung vien goi API cua HR/STAFF -> 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/{{c1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{c1Sso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4c. STAFF goi /match/me -> 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jd6}}/match/me
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 5. Doi min_score -> goi lai ra diem moi (khong tra ban dem cu) ##############################
# Dung JD DRAFT cua Cong ty A (khong dung JD6/JD7). Sau buoc 5a, JD ...0004 co bo ky nang giong JD6 (SQL 90).

### 5a. HR dat ky nang cho JD DRAFT giong JD6 (SQL min 90) -> 200, van DRAFT
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "skillId": "{{JAVA}}", "required": true, "minScore": 80 },
  { "skillId": "{{SPRING_BOOT}}", "required": true, "minScore": 70 },
  { "skillId": "{{SQL}}", "required": true, "minScore": 90 },
  { "skillId": "{{DOCKER}}", "required": false, "minScore": 50 },
  { "skillId": "{{ENGLISH}}", "required": false, "minScore": 60 },
  { "skillId": "{{GIT}}", "required": false, "minScore": 60 }
]

### 5b. STAFF xem C1 tren JD DRAFT -> 200 score 78 (SQL 81.153846/90 chua dat)
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}/match/{{c1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5c. Ha min_score cua SQL tu 90 xuong 80 -> 200 (match_scores.stale = true cho JD nay)
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "skillId": "{{JAVA}}", "required": true, "minScore": 80 },
  { "skillId": "{{SPRING_BOOT}}", "required": true, "minScore": 70 },
  { "skillId": "{{SQL}}", "required": true, "minScore": 80 },
  { "skillId": "{{DOCKER}}", "required": false, "minScore": 50 },
  { "skillId": "{{ENGLISH}}", "required": false, "minScore": 60 },
  { "skillId": "{{GIT}}", "required": false, "minScore": 60 }
]

### 5d. Goi lai -> 200 score 80 (SQL 81.153846 >= 80 nen R = 1: 70*1 + 30*0.333333 = 80), SQL chuyen sang met
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}/match/{{c1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5e. Don dep: xoa het ky nang cua JD DRAFT -> 200 (goi 2a-style tren JD nay se ra score 0, met/missing rong)
# De dat lai 7 JD mau: xoa cac dong company.job_skills, company.jobs (va company.match_scores) roi khoi dong lai company-service voi profile dev.
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[]
